OL,3,GNEWSAFresh NHS Grampian allegations of
OL,4,A'gravest concern' - FM
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe state of NHS Grampian is raised at
OL,7,FFMQs, prompting John Swinney to say
OL,8,Fthat fresh allegations are of the
OL,9,F"gravest concern"
OL,11,FThursday's Q&A comes days after Health
OL,12,FSecretary Angela Constance made a
OL,13,Fstatement in the Scottish Parliament
OL,14,Fabout leadership failings at the health
OL,15,Fboard
OL,17,FShe insisted patients were safe and
OL,18,Fthere would be "full transparency" at
OL,19,Fevery level
